{"5115560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arcade Vault Manager", "steam_appid": 5115560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/ab866ea08a24cda3028c867528ac3b1b.avif?t=1788350362\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras_big/ab866ea08a24cda3028c867528ac3b1b.webp?t=1788350362 width=1560 height=2096 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/dbfd655c29b60df2fe8b7247825aea61.poster.avif?t=1788350362\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/dbfd655c29b60df2fe8b7247825aea61.webm?t=1788350362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/dbfd655c29b60df2fe8b7247825aea61.mp4?t=1788350362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade Vault Manager : Game Sell Simulator is a cozy shop management simulation where you turn an empty space into the retro game store you have always imagined.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/713bf8975d7a00c737dd223ae5f38c98.avif?t=1788350362\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras_big/713bf8975d7a00c737dd223ae5f38c98.webp?t=1788350362 width=1560 height=314 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/64c8b635e25df6bc30977caa56fc2c96.poster.avif?t=1788350362\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/64c8b635e25df6bc30977caa56fc2c96.webm?t=1788350362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/64c8b635e25df6bc30977caa56fc2c96.mp4?t=1788350362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place shelves and displays, organize games and consoles, shape a layout that works for your customers, and give every corner of the shop your own style</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/6ebdec27cce97c48fd8eb44b7b4a9330.avif?t=1788350362\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras_big/6ebdec27cce97c48fd8eb44b7b4a9330.webp?t=1788350362 width=1560 height=314 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/00d00fbd907fb47b1d8474528fc4c630.poster.avif?t=1788350362\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/00d00fbd907fb47b1d8474528fc4c630.webm?t=1788350362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/00d00fbd907fb47b1d8474528fc4c630.mp4?t=1788350362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open the doors when you are ready and run each day on your own terms. Buy new and second-hand stock, inspect every item's condition, estimate its real value, and set prices that balance quick sales with higher profits. Follow demand, new releases, and market trends to decide what to sell, what to hold, and which deals are worth taking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/a5c01327c0923f3411a2d2ae09c558cf.avif?t=1788350362\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras_big/a5c01327c0923f3411a2d2ae09c558cf.webp?t=1788350362 width=1560 height=314 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/c696aacd2af6a8239862c047367190d3.poster.avif?t=1788350362\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/c696aacd2af6a8239862c047367190d3.webm?t=1788350362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/c696aacd2af6a8239862c047367190d3.mp4?t=1788350362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some products are more than ordinary stock. Examine games and consoles closely to uncover rare editions, valuable hardware, and collectible treasures. As new console generations arrive, older products may fade from the spotlight or become sought-after pieces of gaming history.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/33097086d511f26221c4da84338315a4.avif?t=1788350362\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras_big/33097086d511f26221c4da84338315a4.webp?t=1788350362 width=1560 height=314 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/5e1ef951a114ccac03b8c11728a2cd03.poster.avif?t=1788350362\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/5e1ef951a114ccac03b8c11728a2cd03.webm?t=1788350362\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/5e1ef951a114ccac03b8c11728a2cd03.mp4?t=1788350362\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinvest your profits to upgrade the store, unlock new areas, expand your inventory, and hire staff as the business grows. Adapt to every generation and changing market demand. When you are ready to move beyond retail, open a game development office, build and improve your team, and create original games to release and sell through your own store.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and customize your own retro game store</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and sell new and second-hand games and consoles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspect condition, estimate real value, and set your own prices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize displays, manage inventory, and keep shelves stocked</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover rare editions and collectible treasures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Respond to new releases, console generations, and shifting demand</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track product lifecycles and changing collectible value</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade the store, unlock new areas, expand inventory, and hire staff</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open a game development office, build a team, and create original games</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5115560/extras/dbfd655c29b60df2fe8b7247825aea61.p